@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@adminUserId = 2
@employeeId = 1

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Authenticated user context
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
x-user-id: {{adminUserId}}
x-user-role: hr_admin

### List employees from the database (HR admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees
x-user-id: {{adminUserId}}
x-user-role: hr_admin

### List interests and associated employees from the database (HR admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/interests
x-user-id: {{adminUserId}}
x-user-role: hr_admin

### List matches with both employees and any meetings (HR admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches
x-user-id: {{adminUserId}}
x-user-role: hr_admin

### List employee-interest links with employee and interest details (HR admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employee-interests
x-user-id: {{adminUserId}}
x-user-role: hr_admin

### List notifications and their employees (HR admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
x-user-id: {{adminUserId}}
x-user-role: hr_admin

### List HR administrators and their employee records (HR admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/hr-administrators
x-user-id: {{adminUserId}}
x-user-role: hr_admin

### List meetings with matches and both matched employees (HR admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/meetings
x-user-id: {{adminUserId}}
x-user-role: hr_admin

### Get one employee from the database (HR admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/{{employeeId}}
x-user-id: {{adminUserId}}
x-user-role: hr_admin

### Verify unauthenticated database access is rejected (expected 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees

### Verify employee-role database access is rejected (expected 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees
x-user-id: {{employeeId}}
x-user-role: employee

### Verify malformed employee IDs are rejected (expected 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/not-a-number
x-user-id: {{adminUserId}}
x-user-role: hr_admin

### Verify missing employee IDs return not found (expected 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/2147483647
x-user-id: {{adminUserId}}
x-user-role: hr_admin

### Create an employee in the database (HR admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: {{adminUserId}}
x-user-role: hr_admin

{
  "firstName": "API",
  "lastName": "Test",
  "email": "api-test-{{$guid}}@example.com"
}
